<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS view said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS view said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs lowered its earnings estimates on Cisco Systems Inc, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 estimate to $2.05 per share from $2.10.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1998 estimate to $2.60 per share from $2.65.</p>
<p>-- Kept market outpeform rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Late yesterday, Cisco reported third quarter earnings in line with estimates.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
